OL,3,ATwo people rescued from Nepal tunnel
OL,4,Amore than a week after flash flood
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people have been rescued from a
OL,7,Fhydropower tunnel in Nepal nine days
OL,8,Fafter a devastating flash flood at the
OL,9,FNepal-China border, rescuers tell the
OL,10,FBBC
OL,12,FRescue workers cheered as they lifted
OL,13,FSanjaya Shah and Kabir Maharjan to
OL,14,Fsafety - watch the dramatic moment they
OL,15,Fwere freed
OL,17,FAt least 42 people are expected to be
OL,18,Frescued from the tunnel after rescuers
OL,19,Fheard voices early on Friday,
OL,20,Fauthorities tell BBC Nepali
